# wavetable-weather.trk -- "Wavetable Weather", Headless track 2. 118 BPM,
# F minor dub techno, 16 rows per bar, 96 bars.
# intro 8 | A 16 | B 16 (motif) | break 8 | C 24 | outro 16 | end 8
# Fm7 eight bars, Dbmaj7 four, Ebsus4(add9) four. The motif, F Ab G C, is the
# album's D F E A moved to F, called into the echo.

track kick  note len 1                # 1
track hat   note vel len 1            # 2
track ghost note vel len 1            # 3  sixteenth ghost hats in C
track rim   note vel len 1            # 4
track harm  note cva cvb cvd          # 5  the four stab voices
track stab  note vel len 1            # 6  when the four stab voices strike
track sub   note vel from harm        # 7
track motif note vel                  # 8

pattern harm 16x16 harm
1:00  | F3  Ab3 C4  Eb4
9:00  | Db3 F3  Ab3 C4
13:00 | Eb3 Ab3 Bb3 F4

pattern harm8 8x16 harm
1:00 | F3  Ab3 C4  Eb4

pattern harmb 8x16 harm
1:00 | Db3 F3  Ab3 C4
5:00 | Eb3 Ab3 Bb3 F4

pattern harm_end 8x16 harm
1:00 | F3  Ab3 C4  Eb4
8:00 | off

pattern stab 2x16 stab
lane stab ..8.......7.......8.......6..5..

pattern stab_end 8x16 stab
lane stab ..8.......7.......8.......6..5....7.......6.......7...............5...........................4...............................

pattern sub 16 sub
00 | t1-24 .9
05 | off
06 | t1-24 .7
09 | off
10 | t1-24 .8
13 | off

pattern kick 16 kick
lane kick x...x...x...x...

pattern hat 16 hat
lane hat ..5...5...5...57

pattern ghost 16 ghost
lane ghost 3.2.3.2.3.2.3.24

pattern rim 2x16 rim
lane rim ......5...................5..3

pattern motif 4x16 motif
1:02 | F4 .8
1:06 | Ab4 .6
1:10 | G4 .7
2:02 | C5 .85
2:08 | off
3:10 | Ab4 .5
3:14 | G4 .45
4:02 | off

section intro harm8+stab
section a     harm+stab+sub+kick+hat
section b     harm+stab+sub+kick+hat+rim+motif
section brk   harmb+stab+motif
section c     harm+stab+sub+kick+hat+ghost+rim+motif
section c8    harm8+stab+sub+kick+hat+ghost+rim+motif
section outro harm+stab+sub+kick+hat
section end   harm_end+stab_end

order intro a b brk c c8 outro end
